{"id":"637718","name":"盐水鸭","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637718/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭腿","amount":"1000克"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香料包","amount":"一包"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"几个"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香果","amount":"几个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好鸭腿。","img":"images/637718/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧热，转小火，加盐和花椒煸香。","img":"images/637718/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/637718/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盐炒至微黄色时。","img":"images/637718/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"关火，盐晾至温热时，放入鸭腿，用盐拌均匀，揉擦一下。","img":"images/637718/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入盘中，密封好，放入冰箱冷藏一个晚上。","img":"images/637718/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"第二天取出来，清洗干净盐分，多洗几遍哦。","img":"images/637718/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"起锅烧水。","img":"images/637718/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入一个香包，桂皮，八角、香叶、香果、料酒、花椒、米椒。","img":"images/637718/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入腌过的鸭腿。","img":"images/637718/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火烧开，转中小火煮40分钟。","img":"images/637718/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/637718/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"捞出，晾凉。","img":"images/637718/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/637718/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"摆盘，淋上煮鸭子的原汤。","img":"images/637718/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/637718/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637718/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}